From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: d012 setup <setup@localhost>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] The relay is not timed out before the game starts its network

The client only connects once the game calls sceNetAdhocctlInit, so Play
online from the menu waited 12 s on a connection nobody had started and
then fell back to hosting. The wait starts when the network is on.
---
diff --git a/host/adhoc/session.hpp b/host/adhoc/session.hpp
index d7188a3..6ed886f 100644
--- a/host/adhoc/session.hpp
+++ b/host/adhoc/session.hpp
@@ -17,6 +17,8 @@ void adhoc_apply_settings(bool switch_now = false);
 // True while the game is in an ad hoc group or joining one, or hosting:
 // pausing it then would stop it answering the other players.
 [[nodiscard]] bool adhoc_session_active();
+// True once the game has started its network (hle_adhoc.cpp); the client does not connect before.
+[[nodiscard]] bool adhoc_networking_on();
 
 // The product code a player logs in with: the game's, with the profile's edition mark (see GameProfile::adhoc_edition_mark) when
 // the running edition has one. Players of different editions are different products to a server, so they never meet.
diff --git a/host/ui/menu.cpp b/host/ui/menu.cpp
index 44bb6ef..ba82017 100644
--- a/host/ui/menu.cpp
+++ b/host/ui/menu.cpp
@@ -1540,6 +1540,11 @@ void play_together() {
                 if (rd.state == adhoc::ServerState::Online) {
                     relay_timing = false;
                     info_row("Relay", "Connected. Room " + s.adhoc_room + ": share it with the others.");
+                } else if (!adhoc_networking_on()) {
+                    // The client only connects once the game starts its network (Communications Mode), so there is
+                    // nothing to wait for yet: timing it here would give up on a relay that was never tried.
+                    relay_timing = false;
+                    info_row("Relay", "Ready. Enter Communications Mode and the game connects to room " + s.adhoc_room + ".");
                 } else {
                     if (!relay_timing) {
                         relay_timing = true;
